            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Intricate design of a computer chip on a circuit board surrounded by electronic components\" data-id=\"2186449988\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"864\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2186449988/image_2186449988.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">adventtr/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <p><em>Originally published on November 19, 2026</em></p> <p>Let's talk about the Anthropic (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ANT\" title=\"Anthropic, PBC\">ANT</a></span>) IPO.</p> <p>As we discussed in October, its first filing told us it operates in a \"compute-constrained environment where customer demand exceeds available compute.\" Its latest filing</p></body></html>",
